</rp></ruby>び<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まそうとした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I tried to call on my memories of that day.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気温</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きおん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气温</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183231\"><ruby>気温<rp>(</rp><rt>きおん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がると<ruby>関節<rp>(</rp><rt>かんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>痛<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">My joints ache when it gets cold.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:機会\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機会</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>日本人<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">和日本人说话的机会很少。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機械</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机器；机械装置；仪器；器具；